 experience the world of Enhanced, which has become even more beautiful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/extras/bb5e76808de3848a783f0549c34ab32b.avif?t=1757639520\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/extras_big/bb5e76808de3848a783f0549c34ab32b.avif?t=1757639520 width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Opening movie included</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully animated opening movie produced by P.A.WORKS has been added, and the theme song is &quot;GRAVITY ERROR&quot; (sung by Ayane)<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/extras/6581b40891fa20706a2212a9ae39aea4.avif?t=1757639520\" width=570 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>※Other features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Steam Rankings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Steam-specific internet rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faintia rankings have been implemented.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to become the best Faintia user in the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/extras/52a5950d56a09a1a98bf378402a93e6c.avif?t=1757639520\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713940/extras_big/52a5950d56a09a1a98bf378402a93e6c.avif?t=1757639520 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Training mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>・Vertical screen support (arcade mode only)</strong></p>", "short_description": "&quot;Pull the trigger of your heart once again with new friends!&quot;", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>